*** FIRST OPEN THE FOLDER WHERE THESE THREE FILES ARE LOCATED:
    In command prompt:
        cd folder-containing-the-files
        code .
*** 
To compile Pthreads: gcc filename.c -pthread -o programName

To compile OpenMP: gcc filename.c -fopenmp -o programName

To run: ./programName